            { "opt.VehicleCounts.L", "Vehicle count management" },
            { "opt.VehicleCounts.D", "Who decides how many vehicles each timetabled line runs. \"The mod decides\" sizes every line for its measured loop so it can actually hold the interval you set; this is the recommended setting and needs no attention. \"Another mod decides\" leaves vehicle counts completely alone, so a dedicated fleet mod can own them without the two fighting over the same setting. \"I decide, per line\" lets you enter counts yourself; any line you have not set is still sized by the mod. Departure holds work exactly the same in all three." },
