            { "ui.noticeBody", "This mod sizes each line by measuring how long its route really takes. The game's own travel-time estimate falls well short of that, so a line sized from the estimate runs fewer vehicles than your chosen interval needs. Measuring instead means more vehicles than the estimate would give you. They cost nothing to run, but each depot only holds around ten, so watch for \"not enough vehicles\" warnings. If a line asks for more than you want, widen its interval." },
